<speak>Thank you, Mr Tan. Your voice is coming through clearly at my end. I will keep the conversation organised, and when we move between subjects I will say so. That should make your notes easier to follow afterwards. You do not need to keep opening different screens while we talk; if there is an administrative item that needs attention separately, we can keep that separate. Before we get into the main part, how has your week been? Last time you mentioned that the office was shifting some responsibilities around, and that you were spending more time away from your own desk.</speak>